#: software/templates/about_us.html:9
msgid ""
"wger helps you track your workouts, manage your nutrition, and reach your "
"fitness goals. We offer it as free, open-source software you can host "
"yourself, and also provide a convenient, free, and hosted version for easy "
"access."
msgstr ""
"wger vam pomaga slediti vašim treningom, upravljati z vašo prehrano in "
"dosegati vaše cilje fitnesa. Na voljo vam ga dajemo kot svobodno, odprto-"
"kodno programsko opremo, ki jo lahko gostite na svojem računalniku. Ponujamo "
"tudi priročno, hitro dostopno in brezplačno različico, ki jo gostimo na "
"našem strežniku."

#: software/templates/about_us.html:18
msgid "Open Source & free to use ❤️"
msgstr "Svobodno, odprto-kodno in brezplačno ❤️"

#: software/templates/about_us.html:20
msgid ""
"wger is built on the principles of open source. Its code is publicly "
"available, developed by our community, ensuring transparency and giving you "
"control over your data (especially if self-hosting). The free hosted service "
"runs entirely on this open-source foundation. We believe powerful fitness "
"tools should be accessible to everyone."
msgstr ""
"Program wger je izdelan po principih svobodne in odprte-kode. Izvorna koda "
"je javno na voljo, razvija jo naša skupnost, kar zagotavlja transparentnost "
"in vam omogoča nadzor nad vašimi podatki (še posebno če vse gostite na "
"svojem strežniku/računalniku). Brezplačna storitev gostovanja v celoti teče "
"na tej odprto-kodni osnovi. Prepričani smo, da bi morala biti zmogljiva "
"fitnes orodja dostopna vsem."

#: software/templates/about_us.html:30
msgid "How you can help"
msgstr "Kako lahko pomagate"

#: software/templates/about_us.html:40
msgid "Join the Community"
msgstr "Pridružite se skupnosti"

#: software/templates/about_us.html:46
msgid "Join the Discord server"
msgstr "Pridružite se strežniku Discord"

#: software/templates/about_us.html:47
msgid ""
"Hop on the Discord server to chat with the developers and other users, ask "
"questions, or discuss new features."
msgstr ""
"Skočite na strežnik Discord in klepetajte z razvijalci in uporabniki, "
"postavljajte vprašanja ali debatirajte o novih zmožnostih."

#: software/templates/about_us.html:55
msgid "Get news, updates, and announcements about the project on Mastodon."
msgstr ""
"Dobite novice, posodobitve in najave o projektu na družbenem in družabnem "
"omrežju Mastodon."

#: software/templates/about_us.html:61
msgid ""
"Spread the word: Tell your friends, gym buddies, or share on social media! "
"Your enthusiasm helps us grow and reach more people."
msgstr ""
"Razširite dobro besedo: povejte svojim prijateljem, kolegom v telovadnici in "
"delite na družabnih omrežjih. Vaše navdušenje nam pomaga rasti in doseči več "
"ljudi."

