#: weight/templates/import_csv_form.html:4
msgid "Import weight logs"
msgstr "Uvozi denvnike teže"

#: weight/templates/import_csv_form.html:15
msgid ""
"Use this import field to import your weight logs into Workout\n"
"Manager."
msgstr ""
"Uporabite to polje za uvoz dnevnikov teže v \n"
"Upravljalnik treningov."

#: weight/templates/import_csv_form.html:18
msgid ""
"You can copy and paste from your spreadsheet into the text input,\n"
"the system will try to guess the format to import. The only things to "
"consider is\n"
"that the first column is the <strong>date</strong>, the second the "
"<strong>weight</strong>.\n"
"All further columns are ignored. There is a 1000 row limit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lahko kopirate podatke iz svoje preglednice in jih prilepite v vnosno polje. "
"\n"
"Sistem bo poskušal zaznati obliko zapisa za uvoz. Upoštevati morate le, da \n"
"prvi stolpec vsebuje <strong>datum</strong> in drugi <strong>težo</strong>. "
"\n"
"Vsi ostali stolpci bodo prezrti. Vrstic je lahko največ 1000.\n"

#: weight/templates/import_csv_form.html:24
msgid ""
"If there are errors, you can correct or discard them in a\n"
"second step."
msgstr ""
"Če obstajajo napake, jih lahko v drugem koraku \n"
"popravite ali zavržete."

#: weight/templates/import_csv_preview.html:4
msgid "Preview imported CSV entries"
msgstr "Predogled uvoženih vnosov"

#: weight/templates/import_csv_preview.html:9
msgid "Successfully converted values"
msgstr "Uspešno pretvorjene vrednosti"

#: weight/templates/import_csv_preview.html:10
msgid "The following values could be converted."
msgstr "Naslednje vrednosti je bilo moč pretvoriti."

#: weight/templates/import_csv_preview.html:26
msgid "Errors"
msgstr "Napake"

#: weight/templates/import_csv_preview.html:29
msgid "The following values could not be converted."
msgstr "Naslednjih vrednosti ni bilo moč pretvoriti."

#: weight/templates/import_csv_preview.html:31
msgid ""
"These values could not be converted to a weight log entry.\n"
"    The reasons for this could be anything from an unrecognised date or "
"number\n"
"    format, a problem with the encoding or something else. Please check "
"that\n"
"    there are no obvious errors in the list (and correct them if there "
"are!)\n"
"    and try to import the list again."
msgstr ""
"Teh vrednosti ni bilo moč pretvoriti v vnos za dnevnik teže. \n"
"    Razlogov za to je lahko več. Od neprepoznavne oblike zapisa datuma ali "
"števila, \n"
"    do težave s kodiranim naborom znakov ali pa kej tretjega. Preverite, da "
"na \n"
"    seznamu ni očitnih napak (če so, jih lahko popravite) in ponovno \n"
"    poskusite uvoziti seznam."

#: weight/templates/import_csv_preview.html:37
msgid ""
"Remember that the expected structure is <strong>date</strong>\n"
"    on the first columns and <strong>weight</strong> on the second."
msgstr ""
"Pomnite, da je pričakovana struktura <strong>datum</strong> \n"
"    v prvem stolpcu in <strong>teža</strong> v drugem."

#: weight/templates/import_csv_preview.html:54
msgid "There were no errors, all entries could be converted!"
msgstr "Napak ni bilo, vse vnose je bilo moč pretvoriti."

#: weight/templates/import_csv_preview.html:58
msgid "Import all successfully converted entries"
msgstr "Uvozi vse uspešno pretvorjene vnose"

#: weight/templates/import_csv_preview.html:59
msgid ""
"Continue here if you want to import into your weight log all\n"
"entries that were successfully converted. All entries that produced an "
"error\n"
"will simply be ignored. It's up to you to decide whether they are useful\n"
"(unrecognised entries) or not (e.g. headers, comments, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"Nadaljujte tu, če želite v dnevnik teže uvoziti vse vnose, ki so bili "
"uspešno \n"
"pretvorjeni. Vsi vnosi, ki so povzročili napako bodo preprosto prezrti. Vi \n"
"se morate odločiti, ali so uporabni (neprepoznani vnosi) ali ne \n"
"(npr. glave, komentarji, ird.)."

#: weight/templates/import_csv_preview.html:69
msgid "Import"
msgstr "Uvozi"

#: weight/templates/import_csv_preview.html:74
msgid "Or try it again"
msgstr "Ali poskusi znova"

#: weight/templates/import_csv_preview.html:76
msgid ""
"You can correct the list here and re-submit it as often as\n"
"you want."
msgstr ""
"Tukajšnji seznam lahko popravite in ponovno \n"
"poskusite uvoziti kolikorkrat želite."

#: weight/templates/import_csv_preview.html:85
msgid "Re-Submit"
msgstr "Poskusi znova"
